          "short": "$x=0$ or $x=-\\frac12$.",
          "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}x(2x+1)&=0\\\\x&=0\\quad\\text{or}\\quad 2x+1=0\\\\x&=0\\quad\\text{or}\\quad x=-\\frac12\\end{align*}$$",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
