        "answer": {
          "short": "$m=-\\frac13$ or $m=\\frac52$.",
          "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}3m+1&=0\\quad\\text{or}\\quad 2m-5=0\\\\3m&=-1\\quad\\text{or}\\quad 2m=5\\\\m&=-\\frac13\\quad\\text{or}\\quad m=\\frac52\\end{align*}$$",
